  description: Ageless androgynous otherworldly voice, calm resonant and mysterious,
    slow and deliberate, as if heard from everywhere at once, never human-sounding.
  referenceText: I am every note you have ever heard, and every silence between them.
    You have played well. Now listen to what music truly is.
